{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-pickup01|T41", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "« Yeah, yeah. »", "passage": "phone-suspect-pickup01", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Sí, sí. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "origin": "tm"}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-pickup02|T47", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You pick up.", "passage": "phone-suspect-pickup02", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-pickup02|T48", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Hello, hello… »", "passage": "phone-suspect-pickup02", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-pickup02|T49", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Ridiculous sarcastic tone… As obnoxious as usual.", "passage": "phone-suspect-pickup02", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-pickup03|T55", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You finally pick up the phone.", "passage": "phone-suspect-pickup03", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-pickup03|T56", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« About time. I thought I was going to have to bring the entire squad to your place… »", "passage": "phone-suspect-pickup03", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-story|T62", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Listen… It’s… »", "passage": "phone-suspect-story", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-story|T63", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "She pauses. You suddenly hear a ruckus in the background, probably noise at the station. Busset raises her voice.", "passage": "phone-suspect-story", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-story|T64", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Anyone got the time? Hey! Guys? Anyone?! »", "passage": "phone-suspect-story", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-story|T65", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Fuck, they’re all Neanderthals here… Listen, it’s early and I’m wiped out. »", "passage": "phone-suspect-story", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-story|T66", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« So are you, I bet. »", "passage": "phone-suspect-story", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-story|T67", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Let’s get straight to the point. What do you have for me? »", "passage": "phone-suspect-story", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-story|T69", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "In a calm and methodical voice, you start giving her the evidence you collected.", "passage": "phone-suspect-story", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-story|T70", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You start with the first suspect… their connection to the victims… the rumors… then the second suspect… and so on…", "passage": "phone-suspect-story", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-story|T72", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "A few minutes in, she lets out a whistle.", "passage": "phone-suspect-story", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-story02|T77", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Not bad at all. Seriously. You should come give a lesson to the zombies I work with… »", "passage": "phone-suspect-story02", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-suspectremoved|T84", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "A long sigh.", "passage": "phone-suspect-suspectremoved", "source": "textasset", "es": "Un largo suspiro.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "origin": "tm"}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-suspectremoved|T85", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« I have some good news for you. We checked the alibi of one of the suspects I gave you… »", "passage": "phone-suspect-suspectremoved", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-suspectremoved|T86", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "As you listen to her, you turn to the board and pull down the suspect she’s referring to.", "passage": "phone-suspect-suspectremoved", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-suspectremoved|T87", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« … so, it’s gotta be someone else. »", "passage": "phone-suspect-suspectremoved", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-suspectremoved|T88", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "She snickers.", "passage": "phone-suspect-suspectremoved", "source": "textasset", "es": "Se ríe por lo bajo.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "origin": "tm"}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-suspectremoved|T89", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« You know how lucky you are? I’m doing your job for you, pal. »", "passage": "phone-suspect-suspectremoved", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-keepon|T94", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Ok. Enough chit chat. I gotta run. »", "passage": "phone-suspect-keepon", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-keepon|T95", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« I’ll call you in two… three days… ok?? »", "passage": "phone-suspect-keepon", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-keepon|T96", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« Understood. »", "passage": "phone-suspect-keepon", "link": "phone-suspect-nextstep-yes", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Entendido. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "origin": "tm"}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-keepon|T97", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« Ok. »", "passage": "phone-suspect-keepon", "link": "phone-suspect-nextstep", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-keepon|T98", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "(Say nothing.)", "passage": "phone-suspect-keepon", "emote": ":silence:", "link": "phone-suspect-nextstep", "source": "textasset", "es": "(No decir nada.)", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "origin": "tm"}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-nextstep-yes|T102", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Good. Good doggie… »", "passage": "phone-suspect-nextstep-yes", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-nextstep|T107", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« I’ll call you in three days and you’d better have what I need to make a proper arrest. »", "passage": "phone-suspect-nextstep", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-nextstep|T108", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« The DA has fangs. We’re pretty sure he’s going to turn into a werewolf at some point. »", "passage": "phone-suspect-nextstep", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-nextstep|T109", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "She babbles on for a while. Her voice becomes softer, but just as sarcastic.", "passage": "phone-suspect-nextstep", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-nextstep|T110", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« That would explain his terrible breath… »", "passage": "phone-suspect-nextstep", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-nextstep|T111", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Ok. I’m out. »", "passage": "phone-suspect-nextstep", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-latepickup|T119", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "A grunt on the other end of the line lets you know the call is not over yet.", "passage": "phone-suspect-latepickup", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-latepickup|T120", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« And next time, don’t dick around with me like that. »", "passage": "phone-suspect-latepickup", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-latepickup|T121", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« I hate wasting my time. »", "passage": "phone-suspect-latepickup", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-end|T127", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "She hangs up.", "passage": "phone-suspect-end", "source": "textasset", "es": "Cuelga.", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "origin": "tm"}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-end|T128", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You hold the handset to your ear for a while. You have just one thing in mind: sleeping.", "passage": "phone-suspect-end", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "925_phone_suspect|phone-suspect-end|T129", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "And forgetting it all.", "passage": "phone-suspect-end", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
